# Placeholder so the Alembic ``versions`` directory exists in version control.
#
# F-12: the directory must exist before ``alembic revision`` can write a revision file.
# The initial revision itself is intentionally NOT created here: generating and testing it
# requires a live PostGIS database (autogenerate + ``alembic upgrade head`` /
# ``alembic downgrade base``), which is outside the authorised verification scope.
# Run ``python scripts/check_migrations.py`` to see the remaining work.
